  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moreover the spirit lifted me up, and brought me unto the east gate of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD's",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "house, which looketh eastward: and behold at the door of the gate five and twenty men; among whom I saw Jaazaniah the son of Azur, and Pelatiah the son of Benaiah, princes of the people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then said he unto me, Son of man, these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the men that devise mischief, and give wicked counsel in this city:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Which say,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "It is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not near; let us build houses: this",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "city is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the caldron, and we",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the flesh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Therefore prophesy against them, prophesy, O son of man.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Spirit of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fell upon me, and said unto me, Speak; Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Thus have ye said, O house of Israel: for I know the things that come into your mind,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "every one of",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye have multiplied your slain in this city, and ye have filled the streets thereof with the slain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore thus saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; Your slain whom ye have laid in the midst of it, they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the flesh, and this",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "city is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the caldron: but I will bring you forth out of the midst of it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye have feared the sword; and I will bring a sword upon you, saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will bring you out of the midst thereof, and deliver you into the hands of strangers, and will execute judgments among you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye shall fall by the sword; I will judge you in the border of Israel; and ye shall know that I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "city",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall not be your caldron, neither shall ye be the flesh in the midst thereof;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will judge you in the border of Israel:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And ye shall know that I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": for ye have not walked in my statutes, neither executed my judgments, but have done after the manners of the heathen that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "round about you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And it came to pass, when I prophesied, that Pelatiah the son of Benaiah died. Then fell I down upon my face, and cried with a loud voice, and said, Ah Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! wilt thou make a full end of the remnant of Israel?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Again the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came unto me, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Son of man, thy brethren,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.11.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.11.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy brethren, the men of thy kindred, and all the house of Israel wholly,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
